es. Manching 380 ha, Kelheim almost 600 ha. <br>10,000<br>late Iron Age. <br>Oppida excavated Manching, Bavaria - Late Iron Age (2nd-3rd centuries BCE)<br>Earth wall 7 KM length enclosed 380 ha<br>Except for 500m wide just inside enclosing wall all parts of the site showed evidence of dense human occupation<br>Evidence from onsite battle indicates date 3rd-2nd centuries BCE.<br>Est. 3,000-10,000 people '}], {'usage.total_tokens': 969, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 926})
